{
    "title": "Knights of Pen and Paper 3",
    "description": "Knights of Pen and Paper 3 RPG is a game of Great Adventures, fearsome Monsters and top-tier Stories. \r\nCombining the Classic Turn-Based Battles with Story Driven Campaign, Knights of Pen and Paper brings you a full and rich RPG experience.\r\n\r\nSo let the dice roll, customize your party and let the bosses know who you are! Battle your way to the mysterious realm of Upsi-Daisies and save the Fantasy world of Paperos.\r\n\r\n* Beautiful Pixel Graphics. Yes, the game has graphics and it looks better than ever.\r\n* Create your own party and customize the characters whenever you want!\r\n* Full Story Driven Campaign for dozens of hours of Role Playing!\r\n* Plenty of hand crafted Side Quests.\r\n* Build and Upgrade your home Village.\r\n* Dark Dungeons and generated Side Quests for meaningful endless content.\r\n* Daily Challenges, Item Upgrading, Hidden Secret Codes and more!\r\n\r\n\u2014-----\r\n\r\nThe ultimate Role Playing experience where you play the players who play Role Playing games brings you that Dungeons & Dragons feel once more!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Knights of Pen and Paper 3 RPG is a game of Great Adventures, fearsome Monsters and top-tier Stories. <br>Combining the Classic Turn-Based Battles with Story Driven Campaign, Knights of Pen and Paper brings you a full and rich RPG experience.<br><br>So let the dice roll, customize your party and let the bosses know who you are! Battle your way to the mysterious realm of Upsi-Daisies and save the Fantasy world of Paperos.<br><br>* Beautiful Pixel Graphics. Yes, the game has graphics and it looks better than ever.<br>* Create your own party and customize the characters whenever you want!<br>* Full Story Driven Campaign for dozens of hours of Role Playing!<br>* Plenty of hand crafted Side Quests.<br>* Build and Upgrade your home Village.<br>* Dark Dungeons and generated Side Quests for meaningful endless content.<br>* Daily Challenges, Item Upgrading, Hidden Secret Codes and more!<br><br>\u2014-----<br><br>The ultimate Role Playing experience where you play the players who play Role Playing games brings you that Dungeons &amp; Dragons feel once more!",
